  "name": "Jade Warlord",
  "type": "effect",
  "img": "modules/titan-vttrpg-compendium/icons/paths/JadeWarrior_Path_Icon.webp",
  "description": "<p>Your body is encased in a construct made of jade energy.</p><ul><li><p>Your <strong>Body</strong> and <strong>Soul</strong> increase by <strong>+2</strong>.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Your <strong>Size</strong> and the <strong>Range</strong> of your <strong>Melee</strong> attacks increase by <strong>+1</strong>.</p></li><li><p>Your <strong>Armor </strong>and<strong> Melee </strong>increase by <strong>+</strong>1.</p></li><li><p>Once per turn, when you make a melee attack, you may give your attack the <strong>Cleave</strong> trait, and cause it to ignore <strong>Armor</strong>.</p></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Open Sans',sans-serif\"><strong style=\"font-weight:normal;\" id=\"docs-internal-guid-dcd12564-7fff-bcb5-c45b-7173bd86e5d6\">This effect lasts until the end of combat, you become </strong><strong>Incapacitated</strong>, or you are <strong>Dying</strong>. After you use this ability, you cannot use any ability with the <strong>Apex</strong> trait until you complete a <strong>Long Rest</strong>.</span></p>",
